Subject: Report the user agent app name as Firefox
Reason: Gecko appends "<UA name>/<version>" to the user agent unless the UA
 name is Firefox, which singled Amaya users out ("... Firefox/159.0
 Amaya/159.0"). MOZ_APP_UA_NAME only accepts implied values, so it is set
 here, as mobile/android/moz.configure does for Firefox for Android.
 Branding and the app name stay Amaya. Issue #4.
Owner: privacy
---
diff --git a/browser/moz.configure b/browser/moz.configure
index 06437aa4ca..371498a195 100644
--- a/browser/moz.configure
+++ b/browser/moz.configure
@@ -14,6 +14,8 @@ imply_option("MOZ_PROFILE_MIGRATOR", True)
 
 
 imply_option("MOZ_APP_VENDOR", "Amaya")
+# Amaya: UA ends in "Firefox/<ver>" with no "Amaya/<ver>" app token.
+imply_option("MOZ_APP_UA_NAME", "Firefox")
 imply_option("MOZ_APP_ID", "{ec8030f7-c20a-464f-9b0e-13a3a9e97384}")
 # Include the DevTools client, not just the server (which is the default)
 imply_option("MOZ_DEVTOOLS", "all")
